// IntroString :
"P904960075" "I hate the Circle of Thorns. Their mystics are responsible for bringing in more demons into this world than anyone, and that ain't healthy for anyone, hero or villain. Y'see, if demons get their toehold into our world, they won't stop until they rule it all - including you and me.<br><br>One of the local Circle mystics has been askin' about, trying to find more stuff on the Wailers. He wants to get control over a new type of demon in order to expand his power base. I want you to take him down - permanent-like. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the secret caves where the Circle mystic is making a pact with a Wailer demon, and take 'em down!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P246003323" "Defeat Circle and Wailer negotiators"
// SendOffString :
"P4038190860" "Just wipe 'em out. We're all better off without 'em."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2551511371" "What you waitin' for? You want the Circle callin' Wailers on your head? Get movin'!"

