// Dialog :
"P356442379" "You got the Demon Box? Perfect.<br><br>Look, I know you must be sick of me tellin' you what to do, so this is where you get the payoff. The Demon Box has got some major mojo in it, and the more you use it, the more the demons inside suffer as you steal their energy to power the box. Demons suffer, and you get more powerful. Sounds like a sweet deal for both of us! Don't say Hardcase doesn't look after his own."
// RandomFameString :
"P3677029311" "{VillainName} had some play time with the Carnival!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_SM_Hardcase_Mission_3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P170693753" "There's some weird stuff goin' on with the Wailers. I hear they've been seen diggin' tunnels in the sewers beneath Babylon and the Golden Giza. Considering there's no demons found inside the Golden Giza, they must be trying to avoid something which is keepin' them out. If they succeed, they'll wreck Babylon, which'll kill the money flowin' through St. Martial. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Stop the Wailers from entering Babylon.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2146453259" "Defeat all Wailers"
// SendOffString :
"P789288191" "Take out all the Wailers. We can't risk any of them getting into Babylon."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P343151389" "You waitin' for Babylon to fall?  Get goin'!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2208103429" "The screech of the sewer grate is echoed by demons in the depths."

