"P2585650941" "You took out those demons? Good - when I head to the Giza tonight I won't have to worry about dealin' with Wailers!"
// RandomFameString :
"P792972303" "Why the heck was {VillainName} mucking around in the sewers beneath St. Martial?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_SM_Hardcase_Mission_4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1731269280" "We got some trouble. All the local mystics have been freakin' out about demons in the spirit world, sayin' they're ripping apart some kinda magical essence there. This don't sound good, and I'm thinkin' this might have somethin' to do with the Giza.<br><br>There's a guy over in Cap Au Diable named Virgil Tarikoss. I helped Tarikoss with a demon problem at one point, and he owes me one. He'll be expecting you, and will open a portal to the spirit world, allowing you to enter. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head into the spirit world and stop whatever the demons are up to.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2935104033" "Stop Wailers in spirit world"
// SendOffString :
"P1890078545" "This is gonna be a bit weird, but hang tough and take out those Wailers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_SM_Hardcase_Mission_4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P767377182" "Speak with Virgil Tarikoss"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4053235513" "You talk to Tarikoss yet? He ain't gonna hold that portal open for you forever."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P511725809" "Hardcase sent you? Yes, I will open the portal for you so you may enter the spirit world. Know that this settles the deal I have made with Hardcase."

