// Task - SL6_SM_Hardcase_Mission_5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BanishingRitual 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1416557898" "Banishing Ritual of Tarixus"
// DetailString :
"P3552454496" "This ritual calls upon the power of Mu to permanently banish otherworldly entities."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1441250387" "There's all kinds of banishing rituals you can perform when dealing with demons. Some rituals require true names of demons, some require a part of the contract they made with a mortal, some require rare magical ingredients. Needless to say, it's a good idea for a demon hunter to have as many as possible at your disposal - a banishing ritual for all occasions.<br><br>I got an associate on Sharkhead who is willing to pass one on to me in return for a future favor. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Retrieve the banishing ritual from the Archmage Tarixus.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3520477692" "Retrieve banishing ritual"
// SendOffString :
"P613051372" "Watch out - I think the demons suspect what we're up to and might try to take you out!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2590486420" "You got the banishing ritual from Tarixus yet? Get on that!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
