// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3010559289" "I sensed your arrival, {VillainName}. Yes, I can provide a banishing ritual for Hardcase. The demon hunter and I have an understanding; this is a repayment for services he has rendered to me in the past.<br><br>Here is the ritual. Leave now before you draw the Wailers here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2104559455" "You got the ritual? Nice work. Hope the demons didn't cause you too much trouble.<br><br>This ritual is excellent! I better put this sucker away for safekeeping."
// RandomFameString :
"P3827994649" "Wow! What did {VillainName} get jumped by on St. Martial? Whatever they were, they were screaming like banshees!"

