"P3679127402" "Got another problem with our old friends the Wailers. They've been getting aggressive again, attacking people in the local neighborhoods. The local Arachnos authority have been called in, but the local force is havin' trouble dealin' until backup arrives. If you're up for it, <A HREF={ACCEPT}>help the local Arachnos force against the Wailer incursion.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3212202952" "Provide relief against Wailers"
