// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P579182490" "The Carnival of Shadow have been causing problems again. They've been making some deals with the Wailers, gaining power over them by luring people away to use as bargaining chips in pacts with the demons. The Carnival has just taken a bunch of people from a local tenement for the Wailers, and that just ain't cool. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Stop the Carnival from carrying out their deal with the Wailers.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1750095022" "Stop the Carnival pact"
// SendOffString :
"P1853887173" "If we don't prevent these people from being kidnapped, the Wailers are gonna gain more power in St. Martial. Besides, no one deserves their souls ripped away by demons. No one."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3151571313" "You need to recover the kidnap victims and stop the Carnival from making the pact with the Wailers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4182503989" "The shadows seem to be playing tricks on you."

