"P2738357278" "Our old friends in the Circle of Thorns are up to no good. They've been nabbin' some folks from the casino to use as bait for the Wailers, and that's no good for the bottom line in St. Martial. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Rescue these people from the Circle of Thorns.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1075144816" "Rescue casino patrons from Circle"
// SendOffString :
"P502646110" "We got to keep the money flowin' in St. Martial, so let's get those casino customers back."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1098285161" "What you waitin' for, {VillainName}? Tick tock."

