"P4065092554" "Well, it looks like even the Wailers are even trying to make pacts with the Tsoo! I doubt the Tsoo are going to buy into it, but the sum total is the same: if the Wailers get an edge, it could mean St. Martial being overrun by demons. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Break up the meeting between the Wailers and the Tsoo!"
// AcceptString :
"P4055784190" "Break up negotiations"
// SendOffString :
"P1104490546" "No need to start a war with the Tsoo, but at least take out the negotiators."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1898706571" "What you waitin' for? Stop that meeting between the Wailers and the Tsoo!"

